# The owner's brief and any working notes. Never published.
IDEA.md
HANDOFF.md

# Internal working material. Useful locally, not the product.
docs/research/
docs/PLAN.md
docs/NAMING.md
# Here rather than in .git/info/exclude, which does not survive a re-initialised repository, a
# fresh clone or a copied tree. Nothing stops this one being named in a tracked file.
ROADMAP.md

# Design references (mockups, exported assets). Working material, not the product.
references/
